        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Calculates: effective commission rate, shipping cost subsidy, promotional cost, return processing fees, total marketplace cost as % of marketplace revenue; compares vs. own ecommerce cost-to-serve
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2423_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2423_End5" name="Complete">
