Frequency: Monthly; 1–2 platforms
Volume: ~1–2 P&amp;Ls/month
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst
Participants: FP&amp;A Analyst, Ecommerce Dir, Finance Dir
Source: workflow W2424 — Marketplace Channel P&amp;L</bpmn:documentation>
