    <bpmn:process id="W_W2425" name="W2425. Marketplace Performance Dashboard" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily monitoring; monthly deep analysis
Frequency: Daily; 1–2 platforms
Volume: ~12,000–13,000 orders/month (≈30% of the ~42,900 monthly ecommerce orders)
Owner: GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Participants: Ecommerce Dir, Analytics Manager, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2425 — Marketplace Performance Dashboard</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2425_LaneSet2">
