      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2425_Task4" name="Dashboard: orders, revenue, AOV, conversion rate, top SKUs, customer ratings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Dashboard: orders, revenue, AOV, conversion rate, top SKUs, customer ratings, return rate, stock-out rate; daily review for anomalies; monthly deep analysis with optimization recommendations
Responsible (R): System / GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 30 min/day + 4–6 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
